{"words": [{"text": "وَحَآجَّهُۥ", "translation": "And argued with him"}, {"text": "قَوْمُهُۥ ۚ", "translation": "his people"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "أَتُحَـٰٓجُّوٓنِّى", "translation": "Do you argue with me"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "concerning"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَقَدْ", "translation": "while certainly"}, {"text": "هَدَىٰنِ ۚ", "translation": "He has guided me"}, {"text": "وَلَآ", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "أَخَافُ", "translation": "(do) I fear"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "تُشْرِكُونَ", "translation": "you associate"}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ", "translation": "with Him"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "unless"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "[that]"}, {"text": "يَشَآءَ", "translation": "wills"}, {"text": "رَبِّى", "translation": "my Lord"}, {"text": "شَيْـًۭٔا ۗ", "translation": "anything"}, {"text": "وَسِعَ", "translation": "Encompasses"}, {"text": "رَبِّى", "translation": "my Lord"}, {"text": "كُلَّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍ", "translation": "thing"}, {"text": "عِلْمًا ۗ", "translation": "(in) knowledge"}, {"text": "أَفَلَا", "translation": "Then will not"}, {"text": "تَتَذَكَّرُونَ", "translation": "you take heed"}], "sahih": "And his people argued with him. He said, \"Do you argue with me concerning Allāh while He has guided me? And I fear not what you associate with Him [and will not be harmed] unless my Lord should will something. My Lord encompasses all things in knowledge; then will you not remember?"}